Interview Questions
Which OS type is used in modern laptops?

Answer:

Primarily:

Multitasking OS
Time-Sharing OS
Multiprocessing OS
Multiuser OS

all at the same time.

Which OS is used in airplanes?

Answer:

Real-Time Operating System (RTOS).

Difference between Multiprogramming and Multitasking?
Multiprogramming focuses on CPU utilization.
Multitasking focuses on running multiple tasks interactively.
Difference between Distributed OS and Network OS?
Distributed OS appears as a single system.
Network OS appears as multiple connected systems.
